WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.051
Mount the batch steam peeler and skin remover.

00:00:03.121 --> 00:00:07.551
Each batch needs a cycle request and a matching
completion before discharge.

00:00:07.761 --> 00:00:14.726
Connect vessel cycle complete to DI03, then
connect DO03 to the batch sequencer request.

00:00:14.796 --> 00:00:17.408
These are two distinct digital signals.

00:00:17.618 --> 00:00:21.010
Set the model exposure timer to 16 seconds.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.854
The expiry of that timer alone does not prove
completion.

00:00:25.064 --> 00:00:27.483
Inject cycle completion absent.

00:00:27.553 --> 00:00:32.833
Keep the batch identity open and observe
discharge held while its request is outstanding.

00:00:33.043 --> 00:00:36.434
Confirm the completed batch and restore the
handshake.

00:00:36.504 --> 00:00:42.762
The worked batch delivers 921.2 kilograms of
peeled potatoes to cutting.
